@startuml C1_Update_Operation_Plans_Logical_View
title C1 – Update Operation Plans (Context View)

skinparam rectangle {
  BackgroundColor White
  BorderColor Black
  FontColor Black
  FontStyle bold
}
skinparam cloud {
  BackgroundColor LightGray
  BorderColor Black
  FontColor Black
}
skinparam database {
  BackgroundColor Wheat
  BorderColor Black
  FontColor Black
}
skinparam actor {
  BackgroundColor CornflowerBlue
  BorderColor Black
  FontColor White
}

actor "Logistics Operator" as Operator

cloud "Identity Provider\n(OAuth 2.0 / OIDC)" as IAM
cloud "OEM Operation Planning Service" as OEM
rectangle "Port Logistics Management System (PLMS)" as PLMS {
  rectangle "Angular SPA\n(Operation Plans UI)" as SPA
  rectangle "TodoApi\n(OEM Proxy API)" as API
  database "Operational Metadata\n(Cache / Local Catalogs)" as Cache
}

Operator --> SPA : Browser (HTTPS)
SPA --> API : REST JSON (with credentials)
API --> IAM : Validate session / propagate identity
API --> OEM : Forward plan update requests (HTTPS)
SPA --> Cache : Fetch dropdown reference data
API --> Cache : Optional caching of reference catalogues

Operator --> IAM : Login / SSO
OEM --> API : Returns plans, change logs, warnings

@enduml
